      "igbp_date_start": "201402010100",
      "igbp_comment": "Main species cover at the site were Spartina densiflora (51%), Sarcocornia ambigua (10%), Distichlis scoparia (9%), Stenotaphrum secundatum (1%) followed by minor percentages of: Juncus acutus, Coniza floribunda, several sedges and weeds (22%) and 7% of bare soil. The average canopy height was 0.7 m with little phenological variation throughout the year."
